# Recorded input for the accordion example page (widgets/accordion.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 200
# in the default theme: the General header at 8..232 x 8..42 (open, a checkbox below it), the
# Advanced header at 8..232 x 75..109 (closed). Keys are USB HID codes: 44 Space, 40 Enter
# (format: input.Replay).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 200
dt 0.016
pointer 300 190
# 1: hover Advanced
frame
pointer 120 92
# 2: press it: it takes focus
frame
buttons left
# 3: release over it: Advanced opens
frame
buttons
# 4: Space on the focused header: it closes
frame
press 44
# 5: Enter: it opens again
frame
press 40
# 6: press General
frame
pointer 120 25
buttons left
# 7: release: General closes, Advanced moves up
frame
buttons
